Subject: SOP Multi-Target Semantic Compiler Purpose

Description: Canonical SJS authority defining SOP as a source-preserving semantic programming language whose explicitly admitted programs compile through one canonical SemanticIR into proof-carrying exact, neural, hybrid, and derived target projections. This authority forms language meaning and future interfaces only; it grants no compiler implementation, runtime execution, model, provider, tool, database, hardware, deployment, or external-effect authority.

